WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.590
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.180
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed, do they want to protect themselves or other people.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.800
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:12.800
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.380
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.470
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.700
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:38.080
Fortune teller, Fortune teller, please come.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.820
Gon-san, the Inari, are you there?

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.080
Please answer us.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.020
Gon-san! How silly!

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:51.580
Don’t laugh at her! Thanks to Gon-san that she was finally noticed.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.300
Yeah, you were always a nuisance.

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.320
Gon-san, the Inari, please come.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.350
What are you guys doing so late?

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.550
Inao-san, are you again…?

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:08.080
Stop that, Sone-sensei.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.300
If you take away Gon-san, she’ll be a nuisance yet again.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.640
It’s all she has.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.190
Yes, since it’s because of Gon-san that she can be a fortune teller.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:22.610
Be careful! If you’re too mean, you’ll get cursed!

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.460
You too.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.140
Oh, yes!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.470
Don’t let go!

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:31.460
Gon-san has descended upon us.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:35.740
Gon-san, where is Kobayashi-san’s accessory?

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.910
How was your English test?

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.580
Well, I managed.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.900
How lucky! I fell to the bottom.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.310
I found the accessory!

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:51.150
I’m glad. Was my location correct?

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.140
I was surprised!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:57.940
The “rectangular box” was my dresser!
Even though I’d searched through it.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.410
Gon-san can see through anything.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.770
What’s that?

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.100
That’s the Fortune Teller!

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.130
Fortune Teller?

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:11.090
Inao Kaede, in second grade. Fortune telling’s her thing.

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:13.190
She’s apparently pretty accurate.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.670
I didn’t know girls still did that!

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.680
Again, eh?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.720
Whatcha doin’?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:41.000
You have to bury the papers you use.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.560
What a pro!

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:45.400
Kinoshita-san, aren’t you hopeful?

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.670
Can you curse people?

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:49.450
What?

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:55.590
I want you to curse Inose, the counselor.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:05:00.180
He made a big fuss when I missed school, saying I faked being sick.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.850
Even though it was really heavy.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:06.400
He called home asking about my condition.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:10.180
How annoying! It’s almost sexual harassment!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.690
I’m going crazy!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:14.090
But cursing, I…

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.480
You can’t?

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:20.100
It’s not that…

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.240
Please, Inao-san?

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.670
Only this once.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.420
I don’t really understand, but…

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:41.700
I guess it’s fine.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:53.100
Gon-san, please take care of it.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.990
How could something like that work?

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:09.460
Inao-san!

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.630
Thanks! You really did it to Inose!

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:14.730
W-Wait…

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:23.930
You’re amazing, Inao-san,
with this power!

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.950
Not really, I didn’t do anything.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.120
Don’t be so modest!

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:34.310
No, it was Gon-san, he did it for us.

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:37.570
You can even do that?

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:40.060
I can’t look at you the same anymore! You’re amazing!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.050
No, really…

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:46.750
I’m jealous for your omnipotent fox!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:50.900
Gon-san’s my protector. Whatever I say…

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:54.010
Poor Inose-san!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.370
His sprain’s pretty bad, I heard.

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.720
I wonder if that rumor’s true?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:04.640
That he was cursed? I heard about it.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:07.880
Could it have been Hell Correspondence?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.360
Nope.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.180
The second grader, um…

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.640
Inao Kaede-san.

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.320
The Fortune Teller?

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:20.970
Yup, she’s the talk of the whole second grade.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.390
That girl?

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:26.120
Were you in the same Elementary School?

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:32.110
Yeah, but I don’t remember much, since she was a presenceless type.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.750
Sorry, I don’t remember her at all.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:35.630
Oh, that’s what it is.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:40.750
When she came to middle school, she suddenly got a bunch of attention.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:44.250
Suddenly saying she had a fox with her.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.060
She started fortune telling around then.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.960
Of all things, fortune telling!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.560
Gon-san, continue lending me your power.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.150
Yes, this is Inao.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.100
From C-Class?

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:14.240
Yes, Kinoshita-san introduced her to me.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:16.640
What?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:18.660
That’s…

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.160
I undersand, I’ll do it.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:28.440
Who? Yes, from the third grade.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.410
I’m fine; Gon-san’s with me.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.060
Yes.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.950
Gon-san, please take care of it again.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:48.240
Look carefully at the relation between organ placement.

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:54.230
Like the heart and lungs, note the
similarities and differences with humans.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:59.440
Next, these are the organs removed.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:56.900
Who’ll you curse?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.910
Akatsu, the math teacher.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:02.750
This is where the spine is.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.360
Nice.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:02.750
Stop that!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.740
Such bad taste!

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:05.740
Who do you think you are?

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:09.660
Don’t you have a few people you hate?

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.220
Jigoku Shoujo seems like a bother.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:14.100
The Fortune Teller’s quick!

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.840
The Fortune Teller is the best!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.560
You guys are really stupid.

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:23.100
That’ll get you cursed by the fox!

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.850
I don’t know if anything happens to you!

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.950
What curse? Nonesense!

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:33.150
Akie!

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:45.960
I don’t get it, leaving vials there.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.460
I’m glad it was just a scratch.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.600
It could’ve been much worse.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.280
What should I do, Yuzuki?

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:59.870
I’m cursed; someone asked Inao-san!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.250
That’s impossible-

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.770
It’s probably true!

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.510
Gon-san’s called the Lost Inari.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:18.810
As a homeless fox, he came to me.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.020
Can I have a word?

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:24.740
Nishino-san?

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:30.290
I’m sorry I used to make fun of your fortune telling.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:34.200
No, I don’t mind.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.700
And, I have a favor to ask.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:39.830
Sure, say anything.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.100
I want you to kill him.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:46.950
Kill?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:48.960
Who is this?

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:53.390
He’s a college student who lives near
me and has been stalking me.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.090
Stalking?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:58.950
Night and day, he follows me; I’ve reached my limit!

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:01.500
But killing is a bit…

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:06.120
You can do it, right? Or, you don't want
to because I made fun of you?

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.590
No, not that…

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:11.820
Please help me, Inao-san!

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:18.520
I got it. I’ll try.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.390
Inao-san!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:28.150
Oh, Takasugi-san, it’s been a while. What happened to your hand?

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:31.690
Did you curse me?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:32.370
What?

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.150
Did you?

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.650
I haven’t done…

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:36.540
Really?

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.150
You should stop cursing.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.150
It’s not good for anybody.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:46.860
Maybe you should stop before it’s too late, right?

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.160
It doesn’t concern you seniors.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:51.660
What?

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:57.360
People rely on me. I’m not the same!

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:01.640
What is that?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:16.210
I can do this; Gon-san’s with me.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.400
Gon-san, lend me your power.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:38.450
O avatar of the Inari, give this person death!

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:07.660
Morning Inao-san!

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:10.930
Oh, Nishino-san, morning.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.560
How was it?

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.320
It’s fine; I did it.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:17.340
Thanks.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.130
You’re welcome.

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.430
Curse someone, and two holes are created.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.510
Do you want to die this once?

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.520
Yay, I got the lines right!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.640
What was that?

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:50.540
Something troublesome’s got popular.

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:56.180
Cursing him, her, it’s a bargain sale!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.520
They have it built up.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:04.150
So, does she really have a fox with her?

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:07.140
No, that’s just a false impression.

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.650
But they said there were punishments.

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:13.610
It’s coincidence! Occurs often, no?

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:18.650
If someone cursed another, coincidence
becomes an effect of that.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:24.200
But that girl believes in the power of Fortune Telling.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:29.880
She was presenceless before saying things about foxes.

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:33.240
She probably thinks she finally found a role for herself.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:36.030
Although…

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:39.430
Nishino Chizuru, do you remember her?

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:44.400
She accessed us a while back for a stalker, right?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.000
She didn’t submit, did she?

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:53.200
She asked the Fortune Teller to curse and kill him.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.210
Really?

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.250
Kill him, right?

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:59.740
So, what will happen next?

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:03.350
Mail?

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:05.090
It says nothing.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:09.850
That guy’s still alive! What is this?

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:12.410
But… I did it yesterday…

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.650
Are you cutting corners because it’s me?

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.050
Not at all!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.500
Anyway, I’ll try again.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:25.360
It was the most expensive Aburage at the store.

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.480
I splurged on it, so this time…

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:32.070
Please, please, I beg of you!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.320
O avatar of the Inari, give this person death!

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:37.070
Death!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:37.730
Death!

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.660
Death!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.470
Death!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.680
Death!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:53.000
He was watching me again this morning.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.290
Don’t say you can’t really do it.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:56.930
Right?

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:03.380
It’s my first kill, so it’s taking time.

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:05.640
Really!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.480
Fine, hurry up.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:16.710
Are you OK? Your face is all blue!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.900
Hey, what’re you doing?

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:33.480
What was that?

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:41.680
I tried something new, so probably…

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.520
Probably’s not enough!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.520
No, it’s OK. This time, for sure.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.270
Really? No mistakes?

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:50.780
Yes.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:54.190
I’ll leave it to you. I’m trusting you!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:00.280
You’ve been friendly with Nishino-san lately.

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.490
Uh, yeah.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:07.750
She hated the very sight of you; is this your protector again?

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:11.250
Yes, it’s because of Gon-san.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.250
He’s not dead yet!

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.110
What is this?

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.630
Even if you say that…

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:25.160
Fine, it was my mistake to rely on you.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:27.630
Wait a second!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:33.300
Lies! You can’t do anything after all!

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.710
It’s not like that.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:39.940
You liar and cheater! I’ll tell everyone not to get tricked.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:40.340
That’s horrible!

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:44.010
Then, show me some truth.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:48.230
Can you kill him? Can you?

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.660
I can.

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:53.560
Saying something so good again.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:56.040
Really! I’ll kill him!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:03.040
This is your last chance. It’s your only virtue,

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:06.390
so succeed, Fortune Teller.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:21.630
Seventy-three.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:29.660
Inari-sama, please give Gon-san strength.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.810
To curse and kill that man!

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.600
<i>Where should we go after school?</i>

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:39.850
<i>Yeah, what should we do?</i>

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:43.120
<i>Let’s play dodgeball! Sure!</i>

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.100
<i>Everyone come too!</i>

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:56.040
Eighty-six.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:15.770
One hundred…

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:29.590
O avatar of the Inari, listen to me,

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:31.960
give this person swift death!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:44.390
Lies! Why is he still alive!?

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.420
Why doesn’t he die?

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.380
Die!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.000
Die!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:50.870
Die!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.560
Die!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:52.290
Die!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:52.950
Die!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:53.650
Die!

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:54.200
Die!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:54.980
Die!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:55.760
Die!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:56.680
Die!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.620
How would you die for me?

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.240
Gon-san!

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:10.100
Gon-san?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.880
I don’t want to return!

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.600
I still have a way!

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:33.720
I have time!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.230
Your grudge shall be released.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.230
Send

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:45.340
I’m here.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.040
Jigoku Shoujo?

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:57.790
So it ends up like this.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.260
Hone-onna.

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:02.350
Girls like you are stupid.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.420
Take this.

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:19.620
Good! Now I’m saved!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.650
Yes, no more feelings like that!

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:28.030
If you really want to release your hatred, just pull the…

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:36.210
Yes! Die! Everybody look! I killed him!

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:46.560
I’m no nuisance anymore! Everybody can rely on this Fortune Teller!

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:48.850
Curse someone, and two holes are created.

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:59.260
Your grudge is received.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.840
Thank you, Fortune Teller.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.330
Looks like he’s disappeared somewhere.

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:10.840
Good thing you were saved from stalking.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:13.370
Stalking? What are you talking about?

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:14.300
What?

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:16.380
Because that college student…

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:18.970
Oh, that was a lie.

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:20.830
He was just disgusting.

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:24.270
Doesn’t “stalker” seem more real?

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:26.500
But…

00:22:26.980 --> 00:22:32.310
More importantly, my friend has a favor to ask; you’ll accept, right?

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:33.180
What?

00:22:34.030 --> 00:22:36.330
She wants to curse and kill somebody.

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:49.890
I shall release your grudge.

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:49.890
Note: Candle says, Inao Kaede.

00:24:20.710 --> 00:24:21.930
Your name?

00:24:21.930 --> 00:24:23.680
Ichimura Kazuya.

00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:27.150
Your mother owns lots of clothing.

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:28.440
She wants to stay beautiful.

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:33.940
She wants dad to look at her like a long time ago. But…

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:38.320
You like you mother a lot, which is why…

00:24:38.320 --> 00:24:41.250
Please, send him to Hell.

00:24:41.910 --> 00:24:44.430
Your grudge is received.

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.740
Next time: The Goldfish in the Mirror.

00:24:50.790 --> 00:24:55.640
